<title>BELARUS: Belarus May industrial output down 6.1 pct on Apr.</title>
<headline>Belarus May industrial output down 6.1 pct on Apr.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial output in Belarus fell by 6.1 percent in May compared to the previous month but rose by 11.9 percent year-on-year, the Statistics Ministry said.</p>
<p>Industrial output in the first five months of this year was 12.6 percent higher than a year earlier.</p>
<p> BELARUS INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT   May 97  Apr 97	May 96</p>
<p> month/month			-6.1    +1.1	  N/A</p>
<p> year/year			 +11.9   +21.7	 +9.0</p>
